  "title": "Under allowed transitions and a phase map, a handoff's caller holds the room's phase as its target holds the next: an agent the room moved past, or in no stage, is refused; a known one the map does not name passes, one that is neither passes as the room's active agent, or its default agent while none is active; and a handler with no phase map ties no caller to a phase",
